da means no, god is False: Says da when asked P ⇔ P; 'would you say da' = P; he lies → says da ⇔ P... wait: da=no-word; the False god says the no-word when the proposition is true. So says da ⇔ "would you say da" is true ⇔ P. ✓
All four → da ⇔ P."

